WEBVTT

00:01:47.443 --> 00:01:50.818
Soul Contract

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:55.082
11th Contract

00:01:57.429 --> 00:01:59.207
subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:11.480
Zicheng

00:02:11.489 --> 00:02:13.147
Zicheng, come quickly

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:21.580
My lord

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:22.710
It's snowing heavily

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:23.980
The yard is cold and wet

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:25.260
You will get...

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:26.700
If you try spoiling the fun,

00:02:26.707 --> 00:02:28.077
I'll get mad

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.590
Another similar dream like before

00:02:37.597 --> 00:02:39.657
Ever since that ceremony,

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:44.340
I keep dreaming about these 2 people whenever my mind wanders

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.290
Huh?  Isn't this...

00:02:46.297 --> 00:02:48.427
...the street I lived?

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.280
What are we doing here?

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.670
Yang Jinghua

00:02:51.925 --> 00:02:53.144
Today

00:02:53.144 --> 00:02:54.471
is your "first 7th"

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:56.080
"First 7th"

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:59.860
is the day when spirits return home after they died

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:04.400
So, I've been gone for so long

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:09.560
(Note: In Chinese belief, spirits return to say final goodbyes to their loved ones on the 7th day after they died before moving on)

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:11.390
Yang Jinghua, aged 23

00:03:11.393 --> 00:03:13.611
Died in an accident a week ago

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:16.200
Parents passed away when he's 14

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.010
Had no other relatives

00:03:18.018 --> 00:03:20.849
Was raised under government support

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:23.040
Took a job after high school graduation

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.240
Constantly moving places and back to local

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:27.060
Made a living in PC servicing

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.030
A part timer in fortune telling

00:03:29.033 --> 00:03:29.676
Hmph

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:31.159
Not even up to 3 pages long

00:03:31.159 --> 00:03:32.331
and that's all?

00:03:32.331 --> 00:03:35.502
I'll try to dig further for other clues and info

00:03:35.502 --> 00:03:37.705
Judging by Duanmu's diligence,

00:03:37.705 --> 00:03:41.064
he wouldn't simply take in any regular Soul Image

00:03:41.064 --> 00:03:42.987
There's one thing we should take note

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:44.500
On that day Yang Jinghua died,

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:48.120
the Young Master was performing an exorcism at a nearby dump site

00:03:48.127 --> 00:03:49.194
Along the way,

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.360
he saw him had an accident

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:51.790
and then brought him home

00:03:51.798 --> 00:03:54.034
At that time, Young Master was the one calling

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:54.920
for an ambulance

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:55.720
I feel that

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:58.000
this wasn't just a simple accident

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.470
Yang Jinghua

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.928
How did you die?

00:04:01.926 --> 00:04:04.754
It sucks to get killed by a damn truck

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:08.640
I feel better if it's Maserati, Rolls Royce or whatever

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.220
Is there a difference?

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:13.160
Of course, there's a huge difference

00:04:13.166 --> 00:04:14.779
First, my body won't look so mangled

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:17.740
Second, a rich guy would at least give me a fine burial

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.180
Enough blabber,

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:20.760
come check if there's anything

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.080
you want to bring back

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:24.340
This

00:04:24.346 --> 00:04:25.663
used to be my home

00:04:25.663 --> 00:04:27.237
but now,

00:04:27.237 --> 00:04:29.066
it's none of my concern

00:04:29.066 --> 00:04:31.597
Why bother to feel wistful?

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.300
There's nothing to bring

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.640
Only scraps

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.110
Even this dingy house

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:37.320
was on rental

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:38.720
There's nothing worthy

00:04:38.723 --> 00:04:41.675
I came with nothing, I'll go with nothing

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.000
I'm letting go everything,

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:44.650
I won't take any

00:04:45.331 --> 00:04:46.537
That little Yang

00:04:46.537 --> 00:04:48.302
passed away so young

00:04:49.803 --> 00:04:50.844
How tragic

00:04:51.102 --> 00:04:53.150
The poor kid has no mom or dad

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:54.621
He's gone so easily

00:04:54.621 --> 00:04:57.698
Too bad his money can't be claimed

00:04:57.698 --> 00:05:00.040
He came with nothing and went with nothing

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:02.770
It'd be great if he got to spend more when he's alive

00:05:02.773 --> 00:05:04.305
See?

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.220
I'm such a popular guy

00:05:06.574 --> 00:05:07.419
Yang,

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.700
we never gave you anything good

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:10.780
Now that you're dead,

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:15.200
we'll burn you more joss paper money and consider the few hundred bucks we owed clear (In Chinese customs, burning joss paper crafts serves as offerings for the dead)

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:17.800
I hope you don't come to haunt us for the debts

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:20.480
S-Stop fooling me with these ragged joss paper money

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:21.500
If you won't burn real money,

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.020
I'll give you sleep paralysis tonight

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:25.820
- Pay up! Pay up! Pay up! Pay up!
- Heaven protects us from any haunting

00:05:25.824 --> 00:05:27.002
Stop with the nonsense

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.260
The night Yang died,

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.240
you cried as if your wife passed away

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:31.300
You dare mock me?

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.540
You cried so hard too as if your husband passed away

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:35.980
You should be the crybaby

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.020
You are the crybaby

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.480
You both are showing such grief for me

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.350
by blaming yourselves

00:05:41.357 --> 00:05:43.261
Anyway,

00:05:43.261 --> 00:05:46.291
there's less fun happenings in the hood after he's gone

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:49.980
He used to owe that old man at the crossroad 50 cents daily for the bun

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:51.120
Freaking 50 cents!

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.920
2 weeks ago, he even cheated neighbor Xiao Ming for a candy

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.270
The kid's only 3

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.680
Last time I got a scraggy paper box

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:00.480
He said it contained a blessed gold tablet and sold me for 500

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:01.270
I opened up

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:03.000
It's a damn McDonald's discount coupon

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.130
When it comes to cleaning, he acted lame

00:06:05.136 --> 00:06:07.500
What, a big boy like you having period cramps?

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.460
When asked to pay the bills, he pretended he's not home

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.320
then sang in the shower at midnight

00:06:11.324 --> 00:06:14.016
Look, even this handsome boy can't stand listening

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.360
He's gone too far, right?

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:18.847
Can't you guys talk anything good about me?

00:06:19.944 --> 00:06:21.038
Then again,

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:23.140
when I lost my job,

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:25.460
he's the only one willing to lend me the money

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:27.140
When there's trouble at the shop,

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:29.540
little Yang was the first to sort it out

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:30.540
Little Yang,

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:31.900
we'll burn more for you

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:33.800
so that you'll be rich in the afterlife

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:35.780
You got money to burn but no money to pay?

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:37.360
Where's the protection money?

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:40.890
You dare belittle us, the JQK brothers?

00:06:40.898 --> 00:06:42.678
Today is little Yang's "first 7th"

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.600
Can you not bug us today?

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:45.700
Shut up!

00:06:45.709 --> 00:06:47.225
Pay me the money now

00:06:47.225 --> 00:06:49.928
or else I'll send you guys to meet that pussy Yang

00:06:49.928 --> 00:06:51.741
Who're you calling a pussy?

00:06:51.741 --> 00:06:53.445
You should get beaten

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:55.060
Hey

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.740
If you wanna kill him, at least get him to pay me first

00:06:57.744 --> 00:06:59.414
Stop it, guys

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.620
- Beat ya
- Damn

00:07:00.623 --> 00:07:02.247
I'm going to cry for help

00:07:03.678 --> 00:07:05.599
Hey Duanmu, what are you doing?

00:07:05.599 --> 00:07:06.787
Let me save them

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:08.780
Let me go

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.300
It's useless

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:11.220
You're a spirit

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:13.400
- You can only touch things with spiritual energy
- If I could give a punch

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:16.080
They're ordinary people, you aren't able to touch them

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:16.820
Yang Jinghua

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:18.200
What are you doing?

00:07:25.839 --> 00:07:27.573
You brat, are you crazy?

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:30.780
Don't you want to beat them?

00:07:33.719 --> 00:07:34.893
I caught it

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:35.780
Just now,

00:07:35.782 --> 00:07:37.939
I transferred the breath of life to you

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.540
Breath of life?

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:42.560
An energy that allows you to touch objects in this world

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.000
Who asked you to be a hero

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.360
and to be stubborn?

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:47.740
Brother K, why you hit me?

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.180
I didn't

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.590
J, why you gave me a quick blow?

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:52.973
I didn't even move

00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:55.644
So, it's Q who did it

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:56.940
Kill him

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:01.420
Damn Q threw the bottle at me, didn't he?

00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:03.660
I just saw the bottle flew on its own

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:05.980
Who threw that?

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:07.960
No one's on the street

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:08.870
Yeah

00:08:08.878 --> 00:08:10.754
Mommy, I'm scared

00:08:11.612 --> 00:08:12.911
A ghost

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.120
JK, wait for me

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:17.470
I'll be a good boy from now on

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.620
It feels great beating this card game

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.610
I pass

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:23.520
but this feels rather strange

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.820
It's because you didn't actually touch them

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.920
but your strong determination

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.920
can affect the reality

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:32.240
Your soul power is extremely strong

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.340
You just need to put your heart into it

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:36.320
Then, you'll be able to do anything

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.230
Little Yang?

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:40.980
How can she see me?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.380
I can see my image reflected in the mirror

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:45.820
Little Yang,

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:47.090
is that you?

00:08:48.965 --> 00:08:50.406
Little Yang

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.020
I know it's you

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:54.110
You're here, aren't you?

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.880
I'm so useless

00:08:55.889 --> 00:08:57.529
I made you worry

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:58.820
but I promise

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:00.690
we'll be fine

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:01.920
How about you?

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.460
How's life over there?

00:09:03.466 --> 00:09:05.075
Do you have any friends?

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:06.420
Do you still get bullied?

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:09.040
Don't you worry

00:09:09.047 --> 00:09:11.094
I'm doing pretty well

00:09:11.094 --> 00:09:12.532
I'm well fed

00:09:12.532 --> 00:09:13.703
I have warm clothes

00:09:13.703 --> 00:09:15.595
I live in a really big house

00:09:15.595 --> 00:09:18.048
My boss sleeps every day

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:19.440
There's not much work to do

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:21.660
Not to mention about the benefits

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:24.640
Don't worry about me

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:26.380
I'm feeling

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:28.072
awesome

00:09:28.072 --> 00:09:29.717
Little Yang!

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.740
All the pretentious relaxed attitude

00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:39.915
Pretending like I'm not concerned

00:09:39.915 --> 00:09:41.884
but right at this moment

00:09:41.884 --> 00:09:44.244
I finally let it all out

00:09:44.541 --> 00:09:46.806
I'm truly dead

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:48.940
Even if I wanna vent my frustrations,

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.760
I can't change the facts now

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.100
but

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:56.680
it's so unfair I hate it!

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:00.070
From now on,

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:02.850
I'm no longer relevant to my previous life

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:05.040
The people I used to know,

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:06.480
my friends

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:07.880
and future

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:10.260
- is involved no more
- Why would you spend 500 for this piece of crap?

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:11.710
Keep your voice down

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.210
Little Yang hasn't eaten in past few days

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.560
We should help him out

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:16.620
Just pretend fool,

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:17.540
got it?

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:20.370
After the "first 7th",

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:22.740
I can no longer live as a spirit

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:24.980
by staying in the human world

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.900
Starting today,

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:27.700
I,

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:29.180
Yang Jinghua,

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:32.710
will live on as a Soul Image

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.680
When I first moved here,

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.490
I worked at an illegal cybercafe

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.860
I was so poor I couldn't pay the rent

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:45.200
She pitied me

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:46.960
and made dinner for me every day

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.870
She even asked him to look after me

00:10:48.873 --> 00:10:50.636
One day, something bad happened at cybercafe

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:52.460
I got beaten up and broke my rib

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.420
She cried and scolded me,

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.860
telling me to change my job

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:56.860
Heh

00:10:56.860 --> 00:11:00.240
A great young Master who's born with a silver spoon in mouth

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:02.040
will never understand

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:03.210
Actually, I

00:11:03.216 --> 00:11:06.071
wasn't born under the Duanmu household

00:11:06.275 --> 00:11:07.103
Huh?

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:10.640
You sit there for a while

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:11.920
I go somewhere else first

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:13.860
Hey, what's with the half-spoken story?

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.040
You wretch

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:18.190
Is he not born under the Duanmu household?

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.070
It's been 9 years

00:11:21.072 --> 00:11:22.950
little Xi came to our house

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:25.307
He's always been smart since young

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:27.060
and quite gifted too

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:30.110
He's so much better compared to his father

00:11:30.119 --> 00:11:31.977
Uncle has passed away so many years

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:32.940
Great grandma,

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.270
you don't need to feel sad

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:36.300
You should take care of yourself

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.760
Too bad for that wicked child

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.990
When uncle passed away,

00:11:41.993 --> 00:11:43.260
auntie was...

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:44.110
Hmph!

00:11:44.118 --> 00:11:46.430
I don't want to hear you speak about her

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:47.399
Siyun

00:11:47.399 --> 00:11:48.664
I'm tired

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:50.240
Yes

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:56.030
I found something very fishy

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:57.311
Yang Jinghua, he...

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.070
Shhh

00:11:59.077 --> 00:12:01.359
We'll talk at our house

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.600
What's up with him?

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:04.560
He's not back yet

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:07.180
Is he trying to make me wait till I go insane?

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:14.900
N-Not again

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:18.500
My lord,

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.340
you don't feel tired playing?

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:21.760
Yes

00:12:21.998 --> 00:12:24.405
All good things come to an end

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:26.520
And when that day comes,

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:27.560
please,

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:30.620
only you

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:35.400
can save everyone

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:42.340
This disturbing dream

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:43.260
What the hell

00:12:43.266 --> 00:12:45.342
is going on?
